<!-- ================= PLATFORM BAND ================= -->
<section class="block" id="platform">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="app-band reveal">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:8px">
          <div class="overline">The Application Advantage</div>
          <h2>Every alternative is an API or a library.<br>ioNova is a <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6ED9DA,#5EA1DC,#8ECDF2);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">full application.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="sub">Parsing is the start, not the job. Operations teams need to see exceptions, work them, and prove compliance &mdash; without building an internal tool first.</p>
        <div class="app-grid">
          <div class="app-card">
            <div class="icon-container ic-cyan"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11Z"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Exceptions Workbench</h3>
            <p>Low-confidence resolutions land in a maker-checker review queue with per-field confidence, the suggested repair, and the exact rule citation behind it. Approve, correct, or escalate &mdash; every action audit-logged.</p>
            <div class="contrast"><b>Alternatives:</b> &ldquo;the customer must build their own review routing engine.&rdquo; &mdash; recurring finding across all ten analyses</div>
          </div>
          <div class="app-card">
            <div class="icon-container ic-blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12A10 10 0 1 1 12 2"/><path d="M22 2 12 12"/><path d="M16 2h6v6"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Live Dashboards</h3>
            <p>Real-time STP rate, exception volumes and ageing, latency percentiles, reason-code distribution and per-country compliance posture &mdash; the evidence pack an FCA, OCC or BaFin examiner asks for, always current.</p>
            <div class="contrast"><b>Alternatives:</b> metrics &ldquo;not documented&rdquo; or &ldquo;vendor-side only, not exposed to the customer.&rdquo;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="app-card">
            <div class="icon-container ic-teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4M6 8l-4 4 4 4M14.5 4l-5 16"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Developer Portal</h3>
            <p>Self-service onboarding, API keys, sandbox with ISO 20022 / SWIFT MT test corpora, OpenAPI specs and integration guides. Your team parses its first message the day access is granted &mdash; not after a procurement-length setup project.</p>
            <div class="contrast"><b>Alternatives:</b> APIs not publicly documented (NTT, StructX, Cat-DI) or DIY open-source setup (SWIFT Parser).</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px">Six ways to integrate &mdash; pick per system, mix freely</h3>
